# REST

## Variables

## 1. Admin
### 1.1 Login (Admin)
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Register (Admin) one time for first time to create admin account
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_FIRSTNAME}}",
    "lastname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_LASTNAME}}",
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password (Admin)
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_RESET_CODE}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_NEW_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN}}

## 2. User
### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.2 Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{$dotenv USER_USERNAME}}",
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}"
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_CODE}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_NEW_PASSWORD}}",
    "passwordConfirmation": "{{$dotenv USER_NEW_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_JWT_TOKEN}}

